  "formBefore": "Schedule\nRankings\nSurfers\nFantasy\nOne Ocean\nStore\nSearch\nSingleEvent Q.\nWSL Pro\nBack to Events\nRegister: QA Single Event card refresh 1792663073213\n\nNov 28 · Morro Bay, California, United States · Men’s\n\nCurrent membership & insurance\n\nMembership\n\nSingle event\n\nEvent credits\n\n1\n\nInsurance credits\n\n0\n\nINSURANCE\n\nChoose your coverage for QA Single Event card refresh 1792663073213\n\nEvery athlete must have injury insurance in place before their first heat — WSL checks this at event check-in, not before. Cover bought through WSL is applied automatically, no proof needed. Cover from elsewhere must meet WSL's minimum coverage requirement, and you'll need to show proof of the policy at check-in.\n\nWhat cover includes\n\nMedical treatment at the event\nEmergency evacuation\n\nUse an existing coverage credit\nChoose from eligible available products below\nThe athlete already has their own insurance\n\nNo charge\n\nFor cover purchased outside WSL. Your entry submits now — bring proof of the policy to event check-in.\nContinue without insurance for now\nYour entry submits with no cover in place. Add cover before competing — the spot may be released if it's still missing by the entry deadline.\nAdd/Upgrade Coverage\nEvent reminders\n\nGet event updates on WhatsApp.\n\nPhone Number\n+1\nSame as my membership phone\nSend me reminders on WhatsApp\nConfirm your entry\n\nEvent entry fee (set aside, not charged yet)\n\nUSD 150\n\nTax\n\nUSD 0\n\nCharged today\n\n$0.00\n\nNo money is taken yet\n\nSet aside on your card\n\n$150.00\n\nCharged only if your place is confirmed\n\nVisa\n**** 4242\n\nUse a New Card\ni\n\nWhat happens next\n\nThis submits the event registration. Insurance must be in place before the athlete competes.\n\nSubmit Event Registration",
